{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scribble Wolf</strong> is a Werewolf game (or social deduction game), in which you can control the character that you have drawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/DrawCharacter.gif?t=1745577664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The battle will be divided into the Townsfolks team and the Werewolves team. However, Townsfolks don\u2019t know who their fellows are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/Briefing.gif?t=1745577664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What Werewolves do: Disguise yourself as a Townsfolk and kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/TodoWolf.gif?t=1745577664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What Townsfolks do: Find the Werewolves who is sneaking among the players and kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/TodoHuman.gif?t=1745577664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conversations with other players can only be done by handwriting. (When Disguising, imitate its handwriting as well.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/Chat.gif?t=1745577664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of items to lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/Item.gif?t=1745577664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Room Creation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 10 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Public / Private setting</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed Rule Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Mosaic button&quot; for when something suspicious appears</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/Mozaic.gif?t=1745577664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Streaming Guideline:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Streaming is OK for individuals / corporations</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monetization is OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permission is not required</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you put a link to this page in the description or something, I\u2019m HAPPY</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539320?t=1745577664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/3b57230b35d502fc8f5b1b26e0424c0b7a86fdcd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745577664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/1da744d6a07239c30bfc83d9995c006baeedbd1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745577664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/1da744d6a07239c30bfc83d9995c006baeedbd1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745577664","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descr